> [As] summertime fun[ fades] into[ memory] and the world[ outside] turns golden and nippy, consider taking a tour that will warm you from the inside out this fall. Whether you’re thinking a bike ride for beer in the mountains of Washington or a mezcal excursion in Mexico, there are many options for you to have a tipple (or five) al fres[co] before winter hits. Here are seven delicious drinking tours across North America to celebrate the new season with a little bit of revelry.
1. Experience history on the Urban Bourbon Trail in Kentucky.
