> [With] Valentine’s Day over I hope you all had a nice day with your loved ones. It’s hard to believe that the month of February is already coming to a close in a week. In my monthly market update I will be pulling numbers for the Men[ife]e’s real estate market. As always my stats are based on single family, det[aches] residences, with 3+ bedrooms and 2+ baths.
