[Login to your] Exchange 2013 CAS server[.]
Start[ the] Exchange Management Shell[.]
[Navigate to Exchange] 2013 binaries[ location], for[ example]:"[C]:\Program Files\[Microsoft]\Exchange Server\V15\Bin".
[Execute] the UpdateCas.ps1 PowerShell script to rebuild OWA interface.
