I love the band Pensive...this is their merch buying center. I like their CD's though.[][][]

=== Text #200 ===
> [So] many things happening this weekend!
The highly anticipated PBS Kids in the Park festival is tomorrow, Saturday, June 21. But there are lot of other events for families to enjoy this weekend as well.
Also on Saturday, check out the free Summer Solstice Celebration at the Indianapolis Museum of Art’s 100 Acre Woods. The Windsor Park Neighborhood Association will also celebrate the solstice with a festival in Fletcher Park from 12 p.m.-11 p.m.
Saturday and Sunday, you can experience Native American culture through myriad experiences on offer at the Eiteljorg Indian Market and Festival.
Saturday, the Irvington Folk Festival features its Children’s Day from 11 a.m.-2 p.m. at Ellenberger Park.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #201 ===
> [Meet] the fighters post event to see who take homes fight of the night bonuses.
Special drink discounts starting at just 100baht, free entry, and FMD style good times.
Chat with the Ring Girls, chill by the pool,[ lounge] on the astroturfed roof top and enjoy a classic mix of music from all genres.[][][][][][]

=== Text #202 ===
> [Hand]made exclusively for Mii amo Spa by Baronessa Cali. The combination of Lavender and Eucalyptus will send your senses in a glorious spin! Both Candle and Diffuser are made in the USA and are white with a red seal. Candle burn time is approximately 55-65 hours. Diffuser will last approximately 4-6 months.
A delightful gift for that tea lover you know. Each beautifully boxed set includes 4 samples of our most popular teas: White Cloud, Sedona Sun, Desert Passion and Enchanting Journey. Each tin contains 1-2 oz of tea.
A detoxifying blend of whole cranberries, black currants, elderberries and rooibos 'red' tea that's naturally caffeine-free.
An energizing blend of Japanese herbs, Siberian ginseng, marigold flowers and passion fruit essence.
Rare white tea leaves laced with sweet toasted coconut and juicy pineapple.
The proper way to make and serve tea when enjoying more than[ one] cup at a time.
For a quiet moment[ alone], the ideal way to make a single cup of tea to sip in relaxing comfort.[][][][][][][][][][]


